# Secrets — never commit. See CLAUDE.md, "Secrets and credentials".
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
credentials.json
service-account*.json

# Operational data and generated artifacts.
# Shipment exports, reports and transport orders carry customer, carrier and
# driver personal data. Keep them out of the repository; anonymized fixtures
# under tests/fixtures/ are the exception.
*.xlsx
*.xlsm
*.csv
*.pdf
*.docx
!tests/fixtures/**
!docs/**
/data/
/exports/
/logs/

# OS and editor noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp
